WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,290
Seventeen years of getting along day and night

2
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,810
Even if not biological

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,290
Better than death

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:08,090
Which daughter of the Su family is going to have a travel engagement?

5
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:09,930
Continuous objects remain unchanged

6
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,050
Still Xiaoyun

7
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,500
The whole Zhongzhou is waiting to see

8
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,180
The Su family cannot afford to lose this person

9
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,820
The old man asked us to go back to his old house on the weekend

10
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,740
The Lu family will also pass by

11
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,660
Brother Tingfeng doesn’t know

12
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,900
But we have to negotiate a marriage contract

13
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,060
The second young master of the Lu family should also go.

14
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:23,980
Big brother is back too

15
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,220
Then should Wen Chen be called back?

16
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,660
Are you asking him to come and embarrass the Su family?

17
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,780
Wait until he is as decent as Xiaoyun before he comes to see me

18
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,180
Don't tell him about this first

19
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,780
Captain Liu, what happened?

20
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,620
Team 1007 has a mission and temporarily leaves the Western Region.

21
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,940
He failed to guard the restricted area and provoked the Ten Thousand Years Demon.

22
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:35,940
Run away now

23
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,500
What did Wen Shouxi say?

24
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,900
He said it doesn't matter

25
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:45,890
Sure enough, they are not ordinary people.

26
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,720
I have to learn to drive as soon as possible. See you on the weekend.
